exit `$COURSE_SLUG`, back to the pursuit.

```sh
rhx education.pursuit.course exit
rhx route.drive
```

exit refuses until every stone before this one has passed. it records the exit, passes this
stone, and moves the bind back to $PURSUIT_ROUTE, where `2.courses.pursue` pushes the next course.

a course ends only by exit: never pass this stone by hand.
